# staff-app production env — Cloudflare Pages (Testnet).
# Auto-filled from /.env.testnet on 2026-05-27.
# Host: https://dicekey-coffee-stamps.pages.dev/staff (staff) + / (customer).
# Same RP_ID as customer-app — one passkey enrolment serves both apps.
# This file is gitignored — see apps/staff-app/.env.production.example.

VITE_NETWORK=testnet
VITE_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org
# .env defines VITE_RPC_PROXY_URL=https://localhost:5174/rpc for localnet dev.
# passkey.ts evaluates `VITE_RPC_PROXY_URL || VITE_RPC_URL`, so we MUST
# override the proxy here or the production bundle hits localhost:5174.
# Testnet RPC is HTTPS so no proxy is needed — point both at the same URL.
